  "body": "WORKSTREAM_CLASS: PRODUCT\nPROTOCOL_ESCALATION: NONE\n\nOwner: `product/release-0.12.1-delivery-record`. PRODUCT / REPOSITORY_POLICY, PR-local legacy; Protocol 1.5.1/source `1a11fe76712ee65ca2160d2ae3789330946a57f2`, v2 deferred.\n\nRecord the actual published 0.12.1 Custodia Preview and installation-kit readiness in current README, roadmap and release/qualification guides; update the two existing current-status assertions. Preserve the historical Unreleased, failed qualifications and missing-material records with their archival scope. Eight changed files: six documents and two assertions. No Core runtime, scripts, workflow, package/version, policy/protocol or published payload changes.\n\nOriginal release [v0.12.1](https://github.com/gabned/provelume/releases/tag/v0.12.1), ID 410870418, published 2026-10-12T17:56:44Z from immutable main/tag source `cd7dc64f3ffb2a17689018b3350f0e1c073abdd4`. Publisher 38282337063 SUCCESS 7/7; #345 merged and #340 completed. Fresh downloads: 25/25 original public assets <=32 MiB size/hash verified, accepted bundle/receipt/offline validators PASS, original readiness bindings and closed 26-asset inventory PASS. Original receipt observation time is unchanged. The complete official kit remains 47,177,228 bytes, above the 32 MiB local transfer limit, with the publisher's native readback evidence kept separate.\n\n## OPEN / BLOCKED\n\nExpected head `e750c0531a4be22f304ab47929db406213578ebd`; expected base/main/tag `cd7dc64f3ffb2a17689018b3350f0e1c073abdd4`.\n\nThe adopted legacy gate requires all latest applicable workflows to succeed. Original CPU run [38289564204](https://github.com/gabned/provelume/actions/runs/38289564204), attempt 1, remains **Windows FAIL, Family 25 Model 1, 26/27, en04/run2 5.797 s > 5 s**. Native first 4.047 s plus an original unpartitioned 1.750 s residual. Successful source CI, target CI, Linux 27/27 and published-installer evidence are separate. Prior preflights remain BLOCKED. No new merge preflight or merge follows while the applicable CPU gate is failed.\n\n[Current audit and verified durable handoff](https://github.com/gabned/provelume/pull/348#issuecomment-6139255156) records two separately authorized instrumented diagnostic observations under owner `product/custodia-windows-phase-diagnosis`. Both are DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY / NOT_EVALUATED and preserve the original FAIL. The first observer exposed Windows clock granularity; the second adds QPC and supervisor-dequeue measurement. GGUF admission, runtime checks, native prefill and IPC/scheduling intervals are separated, with request/PID/CPU records. Neither reproduces the original spike or demonstrates its technical cause. No Core correction or qualification retry is justified by these observations.\n\n[Durable evidence](https://github.com/gabned/provelume/blob/705322700aa65c6428935892ea79d02ac9b58f32/docs/qualification/custodia-windows-phase-20261013/evidence.zip): 9,720,125 bytes, SHA-256 `eff5b7f2a3072c15ab1f31d49837f4cfd8f65af291641f1a07947e20310ade54`; independent GitHub download, all-member restore, source-history clone and fsck PASS. The separate complete local evidence archive retains the three larger public payloads and remains >32 MiB. Historical archives and raw prior preflight files absent from the current filesystem are declared missing; the historical BOUND receipt is not reconstructed. The original current binding recovered from comment 6129996130 is retained separately.\n\nA demonstrated runtime defect requires a minimal correction in a separate PR and owner. Only after all applicable gates pass: fresh preflight, normal expected-head merge, actual parent/tree verification and applicable post-merge checks. No unchanged retry to choose a green, threshold change, waiver or retrospective qualification.\n\nHuman/hardware checks remain unattested; Windows 10 22H2 BLOCKED and targeted cancellation NOT_OBSERVED stay explicit. Site provelume.com has a separate handoff and no Core gate. Published 0.12.0 remains immutable; 0.13.0 remains Iudicium.\n",
